# The kind of an attractor of attractor_entry: a Scott sum of two
# constructors, in order: constructor, with no field; function, whose two
# fields are the list of the entries it depends on, the entries themselves,
# and its recursion (a constructor of attractors/recursion). Read by its position
# (gezi.contest.corpora.claims.Attractors, AttractorKind).
λ export
. export
  (λconstructor function. constructor) λdependencies recursion constructor function. function dependencies recursion
